{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/981270-where-can-i-buy-materials-besides-drivethru","id":981270,"title":"Where can I buy materials besides DriveThru.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-03T21:54:11-07:00","id":981270,"title":"Where can I buy materials besides DriveThru.","content":"The last couple times I have attempted to make purchases from DriveThru have not worked well. I keep getting denied the download. I make the purchase. The amount shows up in my cue at the bank on my credit card. The documents show up in my library. I repeatedly attempt to DL the product. I fight with it for hours. I lose all of my saved passwords, cookies, cache, browsing history, etc., etc., etc. I clean out the computer. I turn it off and restart it. I repeat all these steps hour after hour after hour. Finally, within a day or two it DLd last time. This time I am still waiting, and very angry about the frustration. Is there a place where I can actually get what I buy to DL without the constant pop-ups telling me to do something I have already done, lose all of my contact information with the multiverse, and have to reprove to every website I use and video game I play that I am who I say I am in order to make a purchase of OP and WW products?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cIt was clear to me for a long time that the origins of science had their deep roots in a particular myth, that of invariance.&quot; ~ Giorgio de Santillana<br /> Preface to Hamlet's Mill","edited":{"userid":2345,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","user":"Whithers","date":".  Additional info. 10-04-2016, 12:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","name":"Whithers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2345_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T22:05:34-07:00","id":981273,"title":"","content":"Linking it to your Dropbox didn't work?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T22:17:45-07:00","id":981274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/981270-where-can-i-buy-materials-besides-drivethru?p=981273#post981273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Linking it to your Dropbox didn't work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Just. Again, after hours of fighting with it. Trying one browser after another, cleaning out my computer, etc. etc. This is two months in a row. It used to be I would just go there, pick what I wanted, check-out, download, and start reading. That has not been the case the last couple of months. I am still attempting to collect the CWoD stuff I want in pdf, so I don't have to lug my books down and spread them all over. I am also trying to prep my own stuff using CWoD Setting with NWoD system. When I can afford to buy a few things off my wish list (and add more to it) I really prefer for it to be hassle free.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cIt was clear to me for a long time that the origins of science had their deep roots in a particular myth, that of invariance.&quot; ~ Giorgio de Santillana<br /> Preface to Hamlet's Mill","edited":{"userid":2345,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","user":"Whithers","date":".  Grammar 10-04-2016, 01:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","name":"Whithers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2345_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T10:07:45-07:00","id":981501,"title":"","content":"I'm not aware of any place else that OPP has their products for download.<br /> <br /> The problems you're encountering do sound like browser/website compatibility issues, but since you've already been through the headache I'm assuming you know that.<br /> <br /> The only thing I can think of that would present problems across multiple browsers like that is if there is an anti-virus or anti-malware app running that wants to open/inspect every file and the contents of every zip file between you and the servers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T10:19:49-07:00","id":981504,"title":"","content":"Yeah, have you tried contacting DriveThruRPG about it? They mi